# Audio recovery local pack (mandatory freeze)

Full doc: `docs/audio-recovery-local.md`

## Frozen (no new work)

- Network static-audio / GCS / API proxy / TTS / retries for **phonics**, **spelling word play**, **Speech Coach static corpus**
- AudioManager queue, coalesce, fallback, emergency paths for those surfaces
- New playback-quality / root-cause instrumentation

## Required path (child tap)

`tap → resolveLocalPackUrl → playLocalAudio` in `local-audio-playback.ts`

## Owners

| Surface | Module |
|---------|--------|
| Pack manifest | `public/audio-pack/manifest.json` (build: `pnpm run build:audio-pack`, stub: `pnpm run seed:audio-pack`) |
| Play | `local-audio-playback.ts` |
| Phonics | `phonics-local-playback.ts` + `phonics-audio-engine.ts` when `isLocalAudioRecoveryEnabled()` |
| Hear & Tap | `phonicsEnginePlayWord` only — never `playCvcBlendWithSpeak` |
| Spelling | `spelling-local-playback.ts` + `useSpellingTTS` |
| Coach static | `coach-local-playback.ts` — no TTS on same line |
| Coach dynamic | `useAmyVoice().speak()` only |

Disable local path only for debug: `VITE_LOCAL_AUDIO_RECOVERY=0`.
